<section class="recovery-state" aria-labelledby="link-problem-title">
  <h1 id="link-problem-title" class="recovery-title">This ProcureCore link didn't work</h1>
  <p class="recovery-copy">
    Links in ProcureCore emails work once and expire after a short time, so this one may already
    have been used or be too old.
  </p>
  <ol class="recovery-steps">
    <li>Open ProcureCore on your iPhone, iPad or Mac.</li>
    <li>Go back to what you were doing and try again from there; the app will send you a new link if you need one.</li>
    <li>If it still doesn't work, contact ProcureCore Support using the link below.</li>
  </ol>
</section>
